<title>UK: Oseberg to load equiv 39 standard cargoes in Feb.</title>
<headline>Oseberg to load equiv 39 standard cargoes in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Oseberg crude system is due to load the equivalent of 38.8 standard cargoes of 500,000 barrels each in February, traders said.</p>
</text>
